Pursuant to the provisions of Sections 50022.1 through 50022.10 of the Government Code of the state of California, there is adopted the “Foster City Code,” including the following secondary codes incorporated by reference in whole or in part, including related appendices, as identified in Title 24 of the California Code of Regulations, Parts 2, (Vols. 1 and 2), 2.5, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 9, 10 and 11:

A. Code entitled “California Building Code,” 2025 Edition, published by the International Code Council, with California amendments;

B. Code entitled “California Residential Code,” 2025 Edition, published by the International Code Council, with California amendments;

C. Code entitled “California Mechanical Code,” 2025 Edition, published by the International Association of Plumbing and Mechanical Officials, with California amendments;

D. Code entitled “California Plumbing Code,” 2025 Edition, published by the International Association of Plumbing and Mechanical Officials, with California amendments;

E. Code entitled “California Electrical Code,” 2025 Edition, published by the National Fire Protection Association, with California amendments;

F. Code entitled “California Fire Code,” 2025 Edition, published by the International Code Council, with California amendments;

G. Code entitled “California Energy Code,” 2025 Edition, published by the International Code Council, with California amendments;

H. Code entitled “California Green Building Standards Code,” 2025 Edition, published by the International Code Council;

I. Code entitled “California Existing Building Code,” 2025 Edition, published by the International Code Council;

J. Code entitled “California Wildland-Urban Interface Code,” 2025 Edition, published by the International Code Council.

<table><tbody><tr><td><div class="para">Save and except those portions of the preceding secondary codes as are deleted, modified or amended by provisions of the Foster City Code.</div></td></tr><tr><td><div class="para">From and after the effective date of the ordinances codified in this chapter, the Foster City Code shall constitute the penal and regulatory ordinances of the city of Foster City.</div></td></tr></tbody></table>

(Ord. 696 § 2, 2025)
